 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Locally free modules of constant finite rank",
 "statement": "An $\\mathcal O_S$-module $\\mathcal E$ on a scheme $S$ is\n*locally free of constant rank $d$* if $S$ has a Zariski\nopen cover $(V_a)$ with\n$\\mathcal E|_{V_a}\\cong\\mathcal O_{V_a}^{\\oplus d}$.\nIn particular it is a\nquasi-coherent module; this is the\nmodule convention used in the following vector-bundle definition.",
